767 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/E (The project also aims to integrate an AI-powered conversational chatbot to enhance user interaction. Instead of traditional menu-driven navigation, the chatbot enables users to specify their current location and destination using natural language. This objective focuses on improving usability, reducing user effort, and making the navigation experience more intuitive and interactive, particularly for first-time users.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
768 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/E (A further objective is to model the indoor environment using a grid-based representation of the floor plan, clearly distinguishing walkable and non-walkable areas. This structured spatial modeling enables efficient path computation using a heuristic-based pathfinding algorithm, ensuring that the shortest and most optimal routes are generated accurately.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
769 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 289 0 R
/E (Additionally, the project aims to visualize the computed navigation path clearly on a digital floor plan, highlighting the source, destination, and route for easy interpretation. Finally, the system is designed with scalability in mind, allowing future enhancements such as multi-floor navigation, improved natural language understanding, real-time location tracking, and augmented reality-based guidance.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
