/E (Using YOLO \(You Only Look Once\) for Automatic Number Plate Recognition \(ANPR\) can produce impressive results. YOLO is renowned for its speed and accuracy in detecting multiple objects within images or video frames, making it an excellent choice for ANPR applications.When applied to ANPR, YOLO excels in swiftly identifying license plates and accurately outlining their boundaries. This enables efficient localization of license plates within images or video streams. Thanks to its real-time processing capabilities, YOLO ensures rapid detection of license plates, making it suitable for time-sensitive tasks like traffic monitoring or surveillance systems.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1035 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 304 0 R
/E (Moreover, YOLO demonstrates robustness to various conditions, including differences in lighting, plate orientation, and distance from the camera. This robustness enhances the reliability of ANPR systems across diverse environments.Overall, the integration of YOLO into ANPR systems results in efficient, accurate, and reliable license plate detection and localization, contributing to enhanced performance and effectiveness in applications ranging from law enforcement to parking management.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
